<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>Rustc on 梦兽编程</title><link>https://rexai.top/tags/rustc/</link><description>Recent content in Rustc on 梦兽编程</description><generator>Hugo -- 0.163.3</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>梦兽编程</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://rexai.top/tags/rustc/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>rustc 静默喂错源码：两个路径哈希一撞，B 模块编译的其实是 A 文件</title><link>https://rexai.top/posts/2026-10-22-rustc-path-hash-collision/</link><pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://rexai.top/posts/2026-10-22-rustc-path-hash-collision/</guid><description>rustc 用路径哈希认源文件，而 Rust 的 Path 哈希忽略分隔符，两个目录名对得上就会撞车。撞车后编译器把第一个文件的内容静默喂给第二个，全程无警告。我在 rustc 1.99.0 上复现了两个版本，把机制和风险讲清楚。</description></item></channel></rss>